@startuml
title Request timing
clock "Clock" as C with period 50
binary "Enable" as EN
robust "Web Browser" as WB
concise "Web User" as WU

WB has Processing, Waiting, Idle

@0
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low

@100 as :request
WU is Waiting
WB is Processing
EN is high

@300
WB is Waiting

@500
WU is Idle
WB is Idle
EN is low

@:request
WU -> WB : URL
WB@100 <-> @+200 : {200 ms}
highlight 300 to 500 #Gold : waiting
@enduml
